`flex` is declared `flex float`, so whether a root node asked for a share of
its parent is a numeric question. html answers it by handing the page the
viewport -- `html, body { height: 100% }` and a flex column body -- because a
root has no parent to take a share from.

`zero` is the case the numeric test exists for: a root asking for no share
must not turn that rule on, and the string-typed test it replaced could not
read a float at all, so it never fired and every page carrying a `flex`
field got the viewport whatever the field held. `one` is the other side, and
the two are byte-different in the archive below rather than only in prose.

`plain` writes no style at all, and reaches the same answer by not carrying
the field: `ui.Style` gives none of its fields a default, so an omitted
`style` prop binds an empty literal and `NodeStyleFields` returns nothing to
ask about. It is here because the two routes have to agree -- a page that
never mentions flex and a page that sets it to zero are the same page -- and
because it is the page that would move if `DeclaredDefault` ever went back to
naming a field the declaration said nothing about.

deny out/none/html/zero.html `(?m)^html, body \{ height: 100%; \}` -- flex = 0 asks for no share, so the page keeps document flow
deny out/none/html/zero.html `(?m)^body \{ display: flex` -- same rule, the other half of it
deny out/none/html/plain.html `(?m)^html, body \{ height: 100%; \}` -- a style nobody wrote asks for no share either
deny out/none/html/plain.html `(?m)^body \{ display: flex` -- same rule, the other half of it
deny out/none/html/plain.html `-webkit-line-clamp` -- an omitted style carries no fields at all; a zeroed one would put maxLines:0 here and clamp the element to no lines

-- site.sngl --
import . "sngl:ui"
import nav "sngl:ui/nav"

output { none { html } }

window(title=pages.current.title) {
    nav.stack #pages {
        nav.page #one(href="/one.html", title="One") {
            vbox(style=Style{flex=1.0}) {
                text(value="share")
            }
        }
        nav.page #zero(href="/zero.html", title="Zero") {
            vbox(style=Style{flex=0.0}) {
                text(value="none")
            }
        }
        nav.page #plain(href="/plain.html", title="Plain") {
            vbox {
                text(value="unsaid")
            }
        }
    }
}
-- out/none/html/one.html --
